enson\" title=\"Steve Kenson\">Steve Kenson</a>, <i>et al</i>.&#160;(November 2015). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_Coast_Adventurer%27s_Guide\" title=\"Sword Coast Adventurer's Guide\">Sword Coast Adventurer's Guide</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 82. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-6580-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-6580-9\">978-0-7869-6580-9</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-G&G-p59-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-G&G-p59_6-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Beach\" title=\"Tim Beach\">Tim Beach</a>&#160;(1992). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Gold_%26_Glory\" title=\"Gold & Glory\">Gold &amp; Glory</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 59. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1-56076-334-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/1-56076-334-5\">1-56076-334-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FH-p139-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-FH-p139_7-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Baker\" title=\"Richard Baker\">Richard Baker</a>&#160;(August 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken_House\" title=\"Forsaken House\">Forsaken House</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 139. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3260-0\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3260-0\">0-7869-3260-0</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261029071644\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.111 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.166 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2519/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10435/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4966/2097152 bytes\